WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.536
Oh no!

2
00:00:02.230 --> 00:00:06.817
Maya's whole stand is still down on the ground, and Cloud Town is way up there!

3
00:00:07.510 --> 00:00:10.777
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:11.471 --> 00:00:13.959
This is Episode 72.

5
00:00:14.653 --> 00:00:16.375
Meet the movers.

6
00:00:17.068 --> 00:00:21.348
The lift-cart slides under the whole stand and floats it up in one piece.

7
00:00:22.042 --> 00:00:27.797
The pour-pitcher pours the old notebook into a new one, page by page, while Maya keeps writing.

8
00:00:28.491 --> 00:00:32.583
The bucket-chain passes lemons up, one by one, fast.

9
00:00:33.277 --> 00:00:36.862
The snow-box carries a whole mountain of lemons at once.

10
00:00:37.555 --> 00:00:42.130
And the mail-chute lets friends drop letters the old way, straight into the cloud.

11
00:00:42.824 --> 00:00:47.470
Five movers, one job: get everything up to the cloud, safely.

12
00:00:48.164 --> 00:00:50.735
That is AWS migration.

13
00:00:51.428 --> 00:00:53.421
Now you know the movers!

14
00:00:54.115 --> 00:00:57.700
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

